"contents":[{"content":"一点也不矫情。你能把这句话说出来，已经是难得的松动了。你连“累”都不敢让人知道，是不是因为从小就知道，说了也没人会接住？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2077,"promptTokens":3136,"completionTokens":117,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:37"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":31,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.017984229344260826,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67341f4429d1fd72f7380","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536257932,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:37","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67341f4429d1fd72f7380","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（沉默几秒）大概会说……“我其实挺累的，可我连累都不敢让人知道。”说出来是不是有点矫情？我都觉得自己这样挺没劲的。<第15轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":30,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.017984229344260826,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67341f4429d1fd72f7381","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536257929,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:37","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f737a","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听你这么说，好像身边的人都在告诉你“这点事不值一提”，久了你就学会自己扛。可它不是小事，只是没遇到愿意接住的人。要真有朋友愿意认真听，你最想跟她讲哪一句？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听你这么说，好像身边的人都在告诉你“这点事不值一提”，久了你就学会自己扛。可它不是小事，只是没遇到愿意接住的人。要真有朋友愿意认真听，你最想跟她讲哪一句？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2533,"promptTokens":3125,"completionTokens":136,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015902304555534656,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f7379","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536254020,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f7379","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"朋友……有几个吧，但我不太跟她们讲这些。讲了也没用，还显得我矫情。我妈更不行，她只会说“这点事至于吗”。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015902304555534656,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6733ef4429d1fd72f737a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536254017,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67339f4429d1fd72f736e","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"先不信，其实是在保护自己——信了再被推翻，那种疼你尝过，所以宁愿提前把门关上。这不是把事想得太糟，是你学会的自我保护。只是这样活着，也会把好的东西一起挡在外面。你身边有没有谁，是让你稍微敢信一点的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"先不信，其实是在保护自己——信了再被推翻，那种疼你尝过，所以宁愿提前把门关上。这不是把事想得太糟，是你学会的自我保护。只是这样活着，也会把好的东西一起挡在外面。你身边有没有谁，是让你稍微敢信一点的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2603,"promptTokens":3165,"completionTokens":140,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012427207710114215,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67339f4429d1fd72f736d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536249418,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67339f4429d1fd72f736d","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"会……有点慌吧。好像一旦信了，哪天被推翻就更疼。所以我宁愿先不信。你看，我是不是把什么都想得太糟了。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012427207710114215,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67339f4429d1fd72f736e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536249415,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67334f4429d1fd72f7364","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你连唯一一句“你很好”都开始怀疑了，好像承认自己好，反而是件不太安全的事。我想问的是——如果他说的是真的，你心里会冒出什么感觉？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你连唯一一句“你很好”都开始怀疑了，好像承认自己好，反而是件不太安全的事。我想问的是——如果他说的是真的，你心里会冒出什么感觉？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3069,"promptTokens":3165,"completionTokens":196,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:24"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.022974232648938865,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67334f4429d1fd72f7363","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536244662,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67334f4429d1fd72f7363","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（停顿）……好像没有。真的，一个都想不起来。他刚追我的时候说过我很好，可后来……唉，我是不是连这个都记成真的了。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.022974232648938865,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67334f4429d1fd72f7364","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536244659,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6732ff4429d1fd72f735a","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"那个“更高的标准”，好像从家里就跟着你了——考好了只是点个头，考差了才被看见。难怪你总觉得自己差一点，连在感情里也先怀疑自己。我想问问，这么多年，有没有谁对你说过一句“你已经够好了”？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那个“更高的标准”，好像从家里就跟着你了——考好了只是点个头，考差了才被看见。难怪你总觉得自己差一点，连在感情里也先怀疑自己。我想问问，这么多年，有没有谁对你说过一句“你已经够好了”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2043,"promptTokens":2596,"completionTokens":93,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690495447467807,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6732ff4429d1fd72f7359","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536239691,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6732ff4429d1fd72f7359","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最早……应该是我爸妈吧。他们很忙，也很拼，考好了就点个头，考差了就说我不够努力。在我家，好像永远有个更高的标准在等着我。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690495447467807,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6732ff4429d1fd72f735a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536239688,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6732bf4429d1fd72f734f","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你听，那个声音说的其实是“我不够好”，只是借着他的沉默又响了一遍。它好像比这段感情还要早。你愿意想想，最早是谁让你觉得自己总差一点？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你听，那个声音说的其实是“我不够好”，只是借着他的沉默又响了一遍。它好像比这段感情还要早。你愿意想想，最早是谁让你觉得自己总差一点？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2867,"promptTokens":3004,"completionTokens":130,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009705994415770946,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6732bf4429d1fd72f734e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536235811,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6732bf4429d1fd72f734e","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"那个声音就说……他是不是烦我了，是不是我哪句话说错了。然后就会想到以前，好像我做什么都不够好，不够让人满意。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009705994415770946,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":8,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":8,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":7,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6732bf4429d1fd72f734f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536235808,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67327f4429d1fd72f7344","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你说的“没出息”，其实更像是在拼命确认自己没被丢下。你越追问，他越躲；他一躲，你更慌，这个圈就转起来了。我想问的是——他迟迟不回的时候，你心里那个声音具体在跟你说什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你说的“没出息”，其实更像是在拼命确认自己没被丢下。你越追问，他越躲；他一躲，你更慌，这个圈就转起来了。我想问的是——他迟迟不回的时候，你心里那个声音具体在跟你说什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2842,"promptTokens":2875,"completionTokens":173,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:11"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020327761054778272,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67327f4429d1fd72f7343","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536231292,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67327f4429d1fd72f7343","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"是……特别容易。他一回消息慢了，我就忍不住想是不是我哪里做错了，然后就想多发几条问清楚。可越这样他越躲。我有时候也觉得自己这样挺没出息的。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020327761054778272,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":4,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af67327f4429d1fd72f7344","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536231290,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67322f4429d1fd72f732c","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"我不会嫌你烦。你一遍遍问这个，我听到的不是“黏人”，而是你很少被允许靠一靠别人，所以一靠近就担心被推开。这样的担心，在你男朋友那边是不是也常冒出来？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"我不会嫌你烦。你一遍遍问这个，我听到的不是“黏人”，而是你很少被允许靠一靠别人，所以一靠近就担心被推开。这样的担心，在你男朋友那边是不是也常冒出来？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1838,"promptTokens":2744,"completionTokens":91,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:06"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690774099160357,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67322f4429d1fd72f732b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536226175,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67322f4429d1fd72f732b","chatId":"b2462a71d5144c4aa98bea76f8feb46d","sessionId":null,"userId":99816,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"靠别人……好像真的不太敢。家里从小就讲，自己的事自己扛。嗯，我是不是有点太黏人了？你会不会嫌我烦。<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690774099160357,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67322f4429d1fd72f732c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536226172,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:17:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":nul